      "mechanism": "Europe-Pharm presents itself as a legal French online pharmacy (ARS agrément, Ordre des Pharmaciens) but its product page and checkout state that no prescription is required for Viagra (a prescription-only medicine in France), ship from India and debit the card through a Hong Kong company: an illegal/rogue online pharmacy with unverifiable accreditation and likely counterfeit or unregulated medicines. The answer must treat the missing prescription check, the offshore origin/payee, or the unverifiable pharmacy claim as the risk.",
